<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank rates down in liquid market.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank rates down in liquid market.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell on Wednesday to between eight and 8-15/16 percent, from Tuesday's nine and 9-1/8 percent, amid a liquid private sector market, bankers said.</p>
<p>Average one-week rates also slipped to 8-1/4 and 9-1/8 compared to nine and 9-1/4 percent, the bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
